sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Scenario as Multi-Agent Recon<br/>run()
    participant A1 as Agent 1<br/>network_discovery
    participant A2 as Agent 2<br/>enumerate_services
    participant A3 as Agent 3<br/>assessment
    participant Tools as LangChain Tools
    participant Target as Target Network

    User->>Scenario: nsak scenario run ai-reconnaissance-multi-agent
    activate Scenario

    Note over Scenario,A3: divide-and-conquer:<br/>each step is a fresh create_ai_agent() with its own context

    Scenario->>A1: create_ai_agent(response_format=NetworkDiscoveryTable)<br/>ainvoke(discovery prompt)
    activate A1
    loop ReAct loop
        A1->>Tools: host_configuration() / cli_tool("nmap -sn ...")
        activate Tools
        Tools->>Target: discover subnets, hosts, services
        Target-->>Tools: raw output
        Tools-->>A1: result
        deactivate Tools
    end
    Note right of A1: if structured_response is None<br/>fallback json.loads into NetworkDiscoveryTable
    A1-->>Scenario: NetworkDiscoveryTable
    deactivate A1

    Scenario->>A2: create_ai_agent(response_format=EnumerateServicesResult)<br/>ainvoke(enumerate prompt + discovery table)
    activate A2
    loop ReAct loop
        A2->>Tools: cli_tool("nmap --script ...") NSE
        activate Tools
        Tools->>Target: enumerate discovered services
        Target-->>Tools: NSE output
        Tools-->>A2: result
        deactivate Tools
    end
    A2-->>Scenario: EnumerateServicesResult
    deactivate A2

    Scenario->>A3: create_ai_agent()<br/>ainvoke(assessment prompt + both tables)
    activate A3
    Note right of A3: reasons over both results<br/>no response_format
    A3-->>Scenario: markdown assessment
    deactivate A3

    Note over Scenario: aggregate usage.tokens and<br/>tools_called over A1, A2, A3

    Scenario-->>User: AIReconnaissanceScenarioResult<br/>(tables + assessment + tokens)
    deactivate Scenario
